        <mxCell id="note_c" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this diagram.&lt;/b&gt; Nothing points from the API to the Crawler. The two halves meet only at the Data Access component, which is what keeps a user search from ever triggering a fetch.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared vocabulary.&lt;/b&gt; The enum values in &lt;i&gt;ranking/models.py&lt;/i&gt; are used verbatim by &lt;i&gt;crawler/queryBuilder.py&lt;/i&gt; and the frontend drop-downs, so all three speak the same language without a translation layer." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingRight=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;strokeWidth=1.2;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D9A91A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
